  ],
  "serving_suggestion": "Fill boat-shaped cutlets with homemade soy yogurt, mint, coriander leaves, spring onion and Amla Chatni. Sprinkle some seeds (sunflower, pumpkin), raisins, berries & flaxseed powder. Serve with some raw salad & mixed vegetable sabji.",
  "notes": "A recipe with WHOLE GRAINS (corn flour), RAINBOW VEGGIES (carrot, spring onion, green chilli, vegetables of our choice), BERRIES (amla | Indian gooseberries), NUTS & SEEDS (flaxseed powder, chia seed powder), HERBS & SPICES (various).",
